Krita Nova 62 - Brush Panel: pop-up palette button

At the bottom of the Brush Panel, a button (a ring cut at the top, the
bottom and the right, around a dot) that shows Krita's pop-up palette in the
middle of the canvas, or hides it when it is open. It is highlighted while
the palette is open.

